**Description**: Research the AI-native execution philosophy for an MLE role AND conduct codebase/technical context research to ground the role in real engineering practice. This subtask addresses what fundamentally changes when the MLE is an AI employee (not a human), and uses codebase exploration to understand existing ML infrastructure patterns, tech stacks, and architectural conventions that the AI MLE should be deeply familiar with from day one.

