## 7. MLOps Maturity Framework

Atlassian defines4 levels of MLOps maturity ([MLOps@CoreML Long Term Plan](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202089f42605e1d342df8e8011fe153d216f/pages/5783505356)):

| Level | Name | Key Capabilities |
|-------|------|-----------------|
| 1 | Foundation | Reproducible workflows, versioned code/data/models |
| 2 | Scalable Deployment | Consistent deployment paths, CI/CD for ML |
| 3 | Monitoring & Observability | Closed-loop monitoring, drift detection, auto-retraining triggers |
| 4 | Governance & Scale | Institutionalized best practices, full audit trail, compliance |

