## 2. KPIs and Success Metrics

Based on [Level Up your ML Craft](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020b9c471b742f3414899397c898d2dd049/pages/5585955478), [The ML Ops Playbook](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ITSOL/blog/2025/01/10/4658010200), and [TeamServe Operational Metrics](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~93171358/pages/6081093852):

### 2.1 Model Performance Metrics (ML-Specific)

| Category | Metrics |
|----------|---------|
| **Classification** | Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-Score, AUC-PR, AUC-ROC |
| **Regression** | MSE, RMSE, R-squared |
| **Ranking** | Precision@K, Recall@K, F1@K, NDCG@K, MRR, MAP |
| **Online Impact** | CTR lift, conversion, engagement change, latency delta |
| **Bias/Fairness** | Output parity across demographic groups, red-team findings |
| **LLM Evaluation** | Token usage, output accuracy, hallucination rate, faithfulness |

### 2.2 System/Infrastructure Metrics (P0 Priority)

| Metric | Target/Notes |
|--------|------|
| **Model Latency (p50/p99)** | Per-endpoint SLO in IaC; response times < 5s for analysis requests |
| **Model Invocation Count** | Throughput and QPS monitoring |
| **Error Rates (4xx/5xx)** | Distinguished; 5xx count toward circuit breaker |
| **GPU Utilization** | DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL (0-100%) |
| **GPU Memory Utilization** | DCGM_FI_DEV_FB_FREE / DCGM_FI_DEV_FB_USED; OOM prevention |
| **CPU/Memory Utilization** | Standard compute metrics |
| **Cost per Inference** | Training costs, OpenAI API costs, SageMaker inference costs |
| **Availability/Uptime** | 99.9% target for serving services |

### 2.3 Delivery/Velocity Metrics

| Metric | Description |
|--------|------------|
| **Experiment Count & Velocity** | Number of offline experiments per period (modifications/optimizations to move metrics from X to Y) |
| **E2E Cycle Time** | Time from data prep to model deployment (median: 10weeks historically) |
| **Deployment Frequency** | How often models are promoted to production |
| **Time-to-Production** | Ideation (2w) → Development (3w) → Deployment (2w) → Productionisation (4w) = ~10-11 weeks median ([ML Model Lifecycle](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DataT/pages/1821214251)) |
| **PR Velocity / Count** | Engineering delivery measure |
| **Code Coverage** | Unit/integration test coverage (80% minimum) |

### 2.4 Reliability & Observability Metrics

| Metric | Description |
|--------|------------|
| **Model Drift Detection Rate** | Feature drift (KS test for numeric, Chi-squared for categorical) and label drift ([Feature Drift Detection Architecture](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/KYC/pages/6866709029)) |
| **Time to Detection** | How quickly model performance issues are identified |
| **Time to Resolution (MTTR)** | Speed at which identified issues are resolved |
| **Incident Rate** | On-call incidents, SEV0/SEV1 closed per SLO |
| **Data Quality** | Drift scores, freshness, missing value ratio, volume change |
| **Model Reproducibility** | Ability to reproduce results from tracked experiments |

### 2.5 Cost Management Metrics (Pillar 1 of ML Ops Playbook)

- Exploration & development infrastructure costs
- Training costs (cluster size × runtime)
- OpenAI/LLM API costs (tracked $36K annual savings by monitoring)
- Model inferencing cost (real-time from hosted artifacts)
- GPU power draw and efficiency

